// Disable Powershell Command History | T1070.003 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/powershell/powershell_script/posh_ps_disable_psreadline_command_history.yml
any where powershell.file.script_block_text:"*Remove-Module*" and powershell.file.script_block_text:"*psreadline*"
